      "context": "UI-FIS-30 Settings, phone. US-10, US-15, FD-22, FD-29 · Settings is a tab on a phone. Review leads it, so it always has a home even after its banner is dismissed; its count matches the Transactions badge. Settings also holds what the user menu holds on a computer: Categories (under Lists), Display with the theme, and Sign out (under Account). Every change to budget, cycle, lists and rules is audited. Scrolled to the end: the large title has collapsed into the bar, and the lists pass under the translucent chrome and the tab bar.",
